      "content": "i tried the ice and heat but it isn't doing anything for the actual pain. i really don't want to go to the er for a knee ache, that seems like overkill. can you just tell me what the typical dose is for an adult? if i just take one or two small pills, is that really going to cause a massive problem? i just need some relief so i can sleep.",
